# UNIVERSAL HYPERDIMENSIONAL NUMERIC ENGINE (UHNE)

## Public Domain Dedication — CC0 1.0 Universal

The Universal Hyperdimensional Numeric Engine (UHNE) project is dedicated to the advancement of indigenous-language numerical expression, mathematical education, and computational innovation.

**Numeric Liberation for All Indigenous Tongues.**

The original project materials expressly identified as covered by this dedication are made available under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication, to the extent that the contributor has the legal authority to dedicate them.

